<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile lists bidders for lead.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile lists bidders for lead.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center listed the following bidders for lead at its offering on March 6.</p>
<p>American Iron and Metal Co, 100 tonnes at 30.44 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Specialty Metals and Minerals Inc, 100 tonnes at 32.26 cents.</p>
<p>Parks Pioneer Metals, 20 tonnes at 31.15 cents.</p>
<p>Amerway Inc, 300 tonnes at 31.44 to 31.16 cents.</p>
<p>Hochschild Partners, 600 tonnes at 30.16 to 30.57 cents.</p>
<p>Non-Ferrous Processing, 60 tonnes at 31.51 cents.</p>
<p>Canfield Technologies, 60 tonnes at 31.85 cents.</p>
<p>Ney Smelting &amp; Refining, 160 tonnes at 31.21 to 30.11 cents.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
